## Decisions worth a second look

These are the highest-leverage decisions full-auto made. Verify before going to production:

- **Memory mode** ({{MEMORY_MODE}}) — async means context lags one turn behind facts. Make sure this matches your UX expectations.
- **Capabilities** — paid surfaces. Confirm billing tier covers what's enabled.
- **Personality** ({{Q4}}) — if `brand-locked`, drift still runs server-side; you just suppress it. Monitor `agents.personality.get_recent_shifts` if drift bothers you.
- **User identification** ({{Q3}}) — switching later is non-trivial. Re-confirm with your auth setup.

